# Generated by `npm run preview`. Not committed: it is a view of the system,
# not part of it, and it is one command away at any time.
preview/

# dist/ IS committed on purpose — the Ghost theme's gulp pipeline consumes the
# flat bundle directly, and `npm run check:css` proves it matches the source.

# Deployable static site — built by `gulp site`, published by CI.
_site/

